{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1755311,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":"blue_un","paid":0,"title":"Dream Forge 3.0","festival_id":514223,"organization_id":306,"web_url":"ieeeday.ieeedtu.in\/","start_date":"2026-09-13T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-16T16:00:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"competitions","public_url":"competitions\/dream-forge-30-ieee-day-2026-dtu-new-delhi-1755311","region":"offline","details":"<p><strong>Dream Forge 3.0 &ndash; IEEE DTU&rsquo;s Case Study Challenge<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Think. Create. Compete. <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span>Dream Forge 3.0<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is here to ignite your problem-solving and entrepreneurial mindset! Hosted at <\/span>DTU Main Campus<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, this case competition brings together the sharpest student minds to solve real-world business problems with creativity and impact.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><strong>Guidelines:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Team size:<strong> <\/strong><\/span>1&ndash;4 members<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\">Cross<strong> <\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">College and <\/span>Cross<strong> <\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Specialization students are also Eligible.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Multiple teams from same institution allowed<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\">Quiz<strong>:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Only the registered <\/span>Team Leader<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> will attempt the Preliminary Round quiz on behalf of the team&nbsp;<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A participant can register with only one team<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> <\/span>Registration Deadline<strong>:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> 12th October<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Event Structure:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Preliminary Round &ndash; Online Quiz (via Unstop)<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">An exciting quiz to test participants&rsquo; knowledge of <\/span>business, innovation, and current affairs<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> <\/span><\/li>\n<li>Date<strong>:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> 13th October&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li>\n<li>Duration<strong>:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> 30 minutes<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> <\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Top-performing teams qualify for on-campus rounds.<\/span><\/li>\n<li>Participation:<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> The quiz will be attempted <\/span>only by the registered Team Leader on behalf of the team<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.&nbsp;<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Round 2 &ndash; Case Problem &amp; PPT Preparation&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Qualified teams will receive a <\/span>real-world business problem statement<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> <\/span>&nbsp;one day before event<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Time: <\/span><strong>24 hours<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to research, brainstorm, and prepare a 4<\/span>-slide PPT<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> solution.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Excluding Title and Annexure Slides.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Teams will be allowed to use the internet and publicly available resources for research.&nbsp;<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Round 3 &ndash; Final PPT Presentations (On-Campus)<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The same PPT prepared in Round 2 will be presented before the jury.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Each team gets <\/span>7 minutes<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to present.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Followed by a <\/span>Q&amp;A session (3 minutes)<strong> <\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;with judges.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Evaluation will be based on <\/span>understanding, creativity, feasibility, sustainability, and impact<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"539\">Kindly join the official WhatsApp group to receive <strong data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"512\">important announcements, updates, and further information<\/strong> regarding Dream Forge 3.0.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"607\"><strong data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"572\">Join the WhatsApp Group:<\/strong><\/p>\n<div class=\"   \">\n<div id=\":mr\" class=\"ii gt\">\n<div id=\":mq\" class=\"a3s aiL \">\n<div id=\"avWBGd-20\">\n<div dir=\"auto\">\n<div class=\"gs\">\n<div class=\"   \">\n<div id=\":n5\" class=\"ii gt\">\n<div id=\":n4\" class=\"a3s aiL \">\n<div id=\"avWBGd-20\">\n<div dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https:\/\/chat.whatsapp.com\/Ipcctb9lkgpGWhk9W3waJq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https:\/\/www.google.com\/url?q=https:\/\/chat.